MainMenu
choice←0

:Repeat

⎕←'================================'
⎕←'     ESPRESSO HOUSE SYSTEM'
⎕←'================================'
⎕←''
⎕←'1. Add Product'
⎕←'2. Remove Product'
⎕←'3. Sell Item'
⎕←'4. Update Price'
⎕←'5. Return Money'
⎕←'6. Check Stock'
⎕←'7. Check If Product Exists'
⎕←'8. Refill Stock'
⎕←'9. Print Receipt'
⎕←'10. Inventory Details'
⎕←'11. Total Revenue'
⎕←'12. Statistic of Daily Transactions'
⎕←'13. Low On Stock Products'
⎕←'14. Cheapest Item'
⎕←'15. Top 3 The Most Expensive Item'
⎕←'16. Most Expensive Item'
⎕←'17. Login'
⎕←'0. Exit'
⎕←''

choice←⎕

:Select choice

:Case 1
    ⎕←'Product name:'
    name←⎕
    ⎕←'Price:'
    price←⎕
    ⎕←'Quantity:'
    qty←⎕
    ⎕←'Sold:'
    sold←⎕

    AddProduct (name price qty sold)


:Case 2
    ⎕←'Product name:'
    item←⎕

    RemoveProduct item


:Case 3
    ⎕←'Product name:'
    item←⎕
    ⎕←'Quantity:'
    Qty←⎕

    item SellItem Qty


:Case 4
    ⎕←'Product name:'
    item←⎕
    ⎕←'New price:'
    price←⎕

    item UpdatePrice price


:Case 5
    ⎕←'Product name:'
    item←⎕
    ⎕←'Returned quantity:'
    qty←⎕

    item ReturFunction qty


:Case 6
    ⎕←'Product name:'
    item←⎕

    CheckStock item


:Case 7
    ⎕←'Product name:'
    name←⎕

    CheckIfItemIsOnTheList name


:Case 8
    ⎕←'Product name:'
    item ← ⎕
    ⎕←'Quantity of refill:'
    qty ← ⎕


    item RefillStock qty


:Case 9
    ⎕←'Receipt number:'
    n←⎕

    Receipt n


:Case 10
    AllProductDetails


:Case 11
    TotalRevenue


:Case 12
    StatisticsOfTheDailyRaport

:Case 13
LowOnStock

:Case 14
CheapestItem

:Case 15
Top3ExpensiveItems

:Case 16
MostExpensiveItem

:Case 17
⎕←'Cashier name: '
cashier←⎕
⎕←'Password: '
pass←⎕

cashier Login pass


:Case 0
    ⎕←''
    ⎕←'Thank you for using Espresso House System'


:Else
    ⎕←'Invalid option'


:EndSelect

:Until choice=0
